<title>USA: Oil-Dri Corp of America Q3 shr rises.</title>
<headline>Oil-Dri Corp of America Q3 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter Ended April 30,</p>
<p>					Percent of	 Percent of</p>
<p>			    1997    Sales	  1996	   Sales</p>
<p> Net Sales     $36,002,060   100.0%  $36,427,141	 100.0%</p>
